{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064208/block/singleImage/3269639/df/01M7M4FJ2JAG5C2HACCSEFW7BS.jpg?updatedAt=1794900528\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田邨發生火警。（fb「藍田關注組」截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>藍田啟田邨發生火警。 今日（17日）中午1時43分，藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一個單位發生火警，單位火勢猛烈，黑煙席捲半空。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防到場開喉撲救，約20分鐘將火救熄。初步一男一女吸入濃煙不適。消防正在調查起火原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:50:22.157573+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:28:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:05:23.589086+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:43:44.347962+00:00","content_hash":"fec261f0fd095e2cd885760609b8fe64edc20f7f1c70473c88d54f5df3863300","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:50:22.157573+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}